I'm going on a day trip to Bath.

00:11:02.949 --> 00:11:07.698
-And this is actually a joke. Because,
can you have a look at this word? Bath.

00:11:07.897 --> 00:11:10.742
- It’s like a… “ванна”?

00:11:10.918 --> 00:11:12.647
- Yes, this is like bathroom.

00:11:12.833 --> 00:11:17.796
But this is actually not true and
Bath is the name of the city in England.

00:11:17.979 --> 00:11:20.203
That’s why it is kind of a joke.

00:11:20.299 --> 00:11:25.305
Because Mona, she wants to go with Jane

00:11:25.528 --> 00:11:27.720
but she's got a trip to “Bath”.

00:11:27.911 --> 00:11:31.520
So, let’s have a look at these
examples that I highlighted.

00:11:31.623 --> 00:11:35.172
We have 4 sentences.
We are going to the mall.

00:11:35.331 --> 00:11:39.009
This is Present Continuous.
Okay? Why it’s Present Continuous?

00:11:39.137 --> 00:11:42.608
We are going to the mall
thing weekend. So, it’s not now.

00:11:42.751 --> 00:11:45.096
We are going to the mall this weekend -

00:11:45.207 --> 00:11:49.464
this is actually like future but
we are talking about it now.

00:11:49.552 --> 00:11:54.845
- You have to use Present Continuous
when you are…

00:11:55.535 --> 00:11:57.619
Збираєтесь щось зробити.

00:11:57.753 --> 00:12:01.382
- Okay. We call – fixed arrangements.

00:12:01.497 --> 00:12:03.147
- Yeah, going to.

00:12:03.338 --> 00:12:07.721
- Bravo! Going to is a bit
different but this is the same.

00:12:07.806 --> 00:12:11.082
Do you want to go with us?
Do you want to come with us?

00:12:11.166 --> 00:12:13.990
This is Present Simple.
Why it’s not Continuous?

00:12:14.097 --> 00:12:16.924
- Because it’s now…

00:12:18.115 --> 00:12:21.198
- It’s like proposition in real-time.

00:12:21.349 --> 00:12:24.066
- This is like an
offer in real-time, yes.

00:12:24.234 --> 00:12:28.062
- There is no time. “Do
you want?” – and that’s all.

00:12:28.253 --> 00:12:31.590
But we are talking about
now… Actually, can you imagine…

00:12:31.693 --> 00:12:36.904
Можете собі уявити процес хотіння
