- Це дівчата, так? Можливо
тут Present Continuous.

00:12:47.383 --> 00:12:50.383
- Okay. So, we call it state verbs.

00:12:50.786 --> 00:12:56.619
So, this means that this verb –
want – we can’t use it in Continuous.

00:12:56.740 --> 00:13:00.224
Yes, like love. Can you imagine:
“Are you loving me now?”.

00:13:00.343 --> 00:13:02.462
But in a second “you don’t love me”.

00:13:02.605 --> 00:13:06.490
So, this is happening now, so we
can’t use this verb in Continuous.

00:13:06.578 --> 00:13:10.574
Let’s have a look at this one: “I
am going on a day-trip to Bath”.

00:13:10.773 --> 00:13:12.968
